  "basis": "The exact Q5952145 feature is the raised central plinth, not the complete mausoleum. The contiguous museum Q5684744 footprint includes the longer asymmetric stone platform and stairs. Native +X is approximately north and +Z is east toward the ten-column portico, independently identified by the official tourism description. Existing OSM 30/33 m tower tags conflict with the official 28+ m complete height and are not used. The mapped upper cone radius approximates the lower column envelope, not the published 2.05 m cone radius.",
